clear

units lj
dimension 3

boundary f f f

atom_style bond

read_data 5Oct_layout_test_rw_nosignals.data

mass 1 1.0
mass 2 1.0

bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 40.0 1.0

pair_style lj/cut 2.5

pair_coeff 1 1 0.415 1.0 2.5
pair_coeff 1 2 0.415 1.0 2.5
pair_coeff 2 2 0.415 1.0 2.5

neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms bonds pe ke etotal

run 0